# Density Compare
# Hassium (Hs) — real density 40.7 g/cm³. equal masses: Hassium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Hassium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 5.8mm color: #c060ff at (-20mm, 2.9mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 324.6 g — the water cube is the reference
